@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# App-wide hardening checks: middleware, global pipe and limits.

### CORS REQUESTS
# Needs CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173 in .env, then a restart.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### CORS: allowed origin (expect Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:5173)
GET {{baseUrl}}/batches
Origin: http://localhost:5173

### CORS: disallowed origin (expect no Access-Control-Allow-Origin header, still 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/batches
Origin: http://evil.example

### CORS: no Origin header, as from a non-browser client (expect no Access-Control-Allow-Origin header)
GET {{baseUrl}}/batches

### HEADER REQUESTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Helmet: security headers (expect Content-Security-Policy, Strict-Transport-Security, X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, no X-Powered-By)
GET {{baseUrl}}/batches

### BODY SIZE REQUESTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Body limit: 20 kB JSON body, over the 16 kB limit (expect 413)
POST {{baseUrl}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json

< ./fixtures/oversized-body.json

### OPERATOR INJECTION REQUESTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Operator payload: an object where a string is expected, IsString (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": { "$ne": null },
  "unitPrice": 100,
  "unitWeightGrams": 100
}

### NUMBER BOUND REQUESTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Number bound: 1e300 passes IsInt, rejected by Max (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Huge price",
  "unitPrice": 1e300,
  "unitWeightGrams": 100
}
